sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant Order as OrderService
    participant Allocation as RealTimeAllocationService
    participant Store as RealTimeAllocationStore
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant Engine as AllocationEngine
    participant Pricing as AllocationPricingService

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. START RESERVATION PROCESS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Order,Allocation: Triggered during real-time allocation

    Order->>+Allocation: AllocateAsync(orderId)

    loop Until terminal result or retry limit reached

        Allocation->>+Store: ExecuteInTransactionAsync(allocationCallback)

        Store->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
        DB-->>Store: Transaction started
        deactivate DB

        %% ==========================================
        %% 2. REVALIDATE ORDER AND INVENTORY
        %% ==========================================

        Store->>+Allocation: Execute allocation callback

        Allocation->>+Store: LoadForUpdateAsync(orderId)

        Store->>+DB: SELECT order, batches and inventory FOR UPDATE
        DB-->>Store: Locked records and current balances
        deactivate DB

        Store-->>Allocation: RealTimeAllocationContext
        deactivate Store

        Note over Allocation,DB: Revalidate available stock, batch status, ETA, MLOR and order status

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. EVALUATE CURRENT ALLOCATION
        %% ==========================================

        Allocation->>+Engine: Allocate(request, latestCandidates)

        Engine-->>Allocation: AllocationResult
        deactivate Engine

        alt Order already allocated and reserved

            Note right of Allocation: Reuse existing allocation and quotation

            Allocation-->>Store: Existing allocation result

        else All order lines can be fulfilled

            %% ==========================================
            %% 4. CALCULATE FINAL PRICES
            %% ==========================================

            Allocation->>+Pricing: PriceAsync(selectedBatchParts)

            Note right of Pricing: Apply quantity promotion first,<br/>then shelf-life percentage discount

            Pricing-->>Allocation: Final batch price snapshots
            deactivate Pricing

            %% ==========================================
            %% 5. SAVE RESERVATIONS AND QUOTATION
            %% ==========================================

            Allocation->>+Store: AddRun(), AddAllocation(), AddReservation()

            Note over Allocation,Store: Save all order lines and reservations in one transaction

            Allocation->>Store: AddTransaction(), AddQuote(), AddHistory()

            Allocation->>Store: SaveChangesAsync()

            Store->>+DB: INSERT allocations and reservations
            Note right of DB: UPDATE reserved stock and<br/>INSERT inventory transactions

            DB-->>Store: Stock reservations persisted
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Allocation: Reservation and quotation saved
            deactivate Store

            Allocation-->>Store: Complete allocation result

        else Insufficient eligible stock

            Note over Allocation,Store: No partial reservation is retained

            Allocation->>+Store: AddHistory(), SaveChangesAsync()

            Store->>+DB: UPDATE order status to Insufficient Stock
            DB-->>Store: Shortage recorded without reservation
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Allocation: Shortage result saved
            deactivate Store

            Allocation-->>Store: Insufficient stock result

        else Concurrent inventory change detected

            Note right of Allocation: Signal retryable concurrency conflict

            Allocation-->>Store: AllocationConcurrencyException

        end

        deactivate Allocation

        %% ==========================================
        %% 6. COMMIT OR ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
        %% ==========================================

        alt Concurrency conflict

            Store->>+DB: ROLLBACK TRANSACTION
            DB-->>Store: All tentative changes reverted
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Allocation: Retryable concurrency conflict

        else Transaction completed successfully

            Store->>+DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
            DB-->>Store: Transaction committed
            deactivate DB

            Store-->>Allocation: Committed allocation result

        end

        deactivate Store

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 7. RETURN FINAL ALLOCATION RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    Allocation-->>Order: Final quotation, shortage or concurrency error
    deactivate Allocation

    Note over Order,DB: Physical stock is deducted only when dispatch is confirmed